    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Yeah, focus on delivery latency and inventory stockouts. We're specifically looking at replacing your central processing node with 50 localized edge-AI units—one for each major regional hub. The goal is to ensure that if one region goes down, the rest of the network stays unaffected. Run the numbers and let me know if you see any major red flags in that setup.",
